{"name": "Mystical Demon Farm", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/c88dd64d0dff38067c40f2f69a86d000.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1024\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/1e2b72bd2b55e8dce53e489fb6cdd570.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/1e2b72bd2b55e8dce53e489fb6cdd570.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/1e2b72bd2b55e8dce53e489fb6cdd570.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In a world where Humans, Netherkin, and the Elfin coexist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you are a low-ranking <strong>Elfin</strong> mage sent to the forsaken land of <strong>Mystic Dales</strong> to investigate a mysterious phenomenon known as the <strong>Mana Anomaly</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There, you uncover traces of an artificial lifeform long believed to have vanished after the Great War: the <strong>Demon.</strong><br/>To continue your investigation, you build a farm as your base, hatching and collecting Demons, exploring dungeons , gathering Essences and materials, and steadily expanding your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll chase the truth behind the Mana Anomaly, and uncover the hidden records of the Great War and the three Archmages of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/1dc74205bc009d9a989a4441ba0128c0.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/1dc74205bc009d9a989a4441ba0128c0.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/1dc74205bc009d9a989a4441ba0128c0.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is a 'Demon'?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons are artificial lifeforms created long ago by the three Archmages to help the world.<br/>Because they were artificially made, they were once called <strong>De\u2019monster</strong>\u2014not \u201cmonsters\u201d\u2014and the name eventually shortened to <strong>Demon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/02e018ee7a3808cfc6b651f533ddc7e5.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1024\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/663f03c7a1b97d05b59f9739da0fbcd0.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/663f03c7a1b97d05b59f9739da0fbcd0.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/663f03c7a1b97d05b59f9739da0fbcd0.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hatch and Collect Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather Demon Essence through dungeon exploration and farming, then craft <strong>Cores</strong> to obtain new Demons.<br/>A Core is an egg-like item used to hatch Demons. By inserting additional materials into an activated Core, you can raise the Demon\u2019s level before it hatches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/997c4d0ae2b8b28cbf50ca5402a5a358.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/997c4d0ae2b8b28cbf50ca5402a5a358.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/997c4d0ae2b8b28cbf50ca5402a5a358.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power Up Your Magic Skills and Farm with Your Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In dungeons where mana flows intensely, your tool magic transforms into powerful combat spells. To obtain valuable materials and essences, you\u2019ll need to dive into dungeons and farm hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you invest in skills, the stronger your magic becomes, letting you smash through enemies and obstacles with satisfying force. You can also summon adorable Demons, and they\u2019ll eagerly destroy everything in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/278946d913f00b16f07459c2af0072ae.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/278946d913f00b16f07459c2af0072ae.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/278946d913f00b16f07459c2af0072ae.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your <strong>Dungeon Drill Magic</strong> anywhere in the field to create a ladder straight into a dungeon.<br/>Even inside the dungeon, you can drill deeper and deeper to reach the lower levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"630\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/88d9298ae7b1ec0b1a816f6fd562b332.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/88d9298ae7b1ec0b1a816f6fd562b332.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/88d9298ae7b1ec0b1a816f6fd562b332.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow and Expand Your Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use materials gathered from the dungeon and field to expand your farm. Raise your farm level through activities like item deliveries, Demon collection, and farm upgrades. As your level increases, you\u2019ll unlock new recipes, new Demons, and new areas. Grow your farm to the highest level and earn recognition from the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"646\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/0b2921a88829a8a4711e309db3123254.poster.avif?t=1788504002\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/0b2921a88829a8a4711e309db3123254.webm?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/extras/0b2921a88829a8a4711e309db3123254.mp4?t=1788504002\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Follow the Truth of the Mana Anomaly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through dungeon expeditions and encounters with NPCs, you\u2019ll uncover stories and clues surrounding the Mana Anomaly. Collect long-forgotten records hidden in 'Mystic Dales', and piece together the tale of the Great War as you move one step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mystical Demon Farm is a cute, cozy, but lively farm game that blends farming simulation, monster collecting, and dungeon crawling. Collect Demons, grow your operation, and build an amazing farm worthy of the Queen\u2019s recognition!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201570/66f1a2b66a8fed54f86f12e00abbdf60c0f36001/header.jpg?t=1788504002", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Farming Sim", "Pixel Graphics", "Creature Collector", "Dungeon Crawler", "Singleplayer", "Life Sim"], "developers": "Jarikki Studio", "publishers": "Jarikki Studio", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4201570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/r3Dl-Xe03IY", "first_seen": 1788472800.0, "review_rank": 6}